est mix live in Tokyo.\n\n\n<!--more-->\n\n---\n\nToday we're introducing the Black Label Series, which is focused on highlighting rising vocalists/rappers we're going to be working with.\n\nAs smooth as they are soulful, LA-based group Hablot Brown gives us 5 original tracks that will grab you by the heartstrings. From the vocals to guitar-infused production, the first ever Black Label release will make it hard for you to not follow their journey.\n\nDiscover:<br>\n[soundcloud.com/hablotbrown](https://soundcloud.com/hablotbrown)<br>\n[twitter.com/hablotbrown](https://twitter.com/hablotbrown)<br>\n[instagram.com/hablotbrown/](https://instagram.com/hablotbrown/)\n\n### Credits\n\nReleased July 29th, 2018\nMixed & Mastered by Joshua Pleeter & Austin Brown\nArtwork: Andre Power\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7226,"location":"JP","published_at":"2018-07-28T11:57:25+00:00"},"title":"Yukibeb Set","position":1}},{"id":"YGzUFSBqvbc","position":11,"timestamp":"00:25:12","rawTrack":"Sean Dream - brent","track":{"id":"vfo1PxR7JV4","path":"/artists/sean-dream/tracks/brent/","slug":"brent","title":"brent","artist":{"slug":"sean-dream","title":"Sean Dream"},"artwork":"images/artists/sean-dream/tracks/brent.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"NmPrAfRoF3w","slug":"392","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/station/episode-392/ra.1450726736","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/show-392"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #392","artwork":"images/episodes/392.jpg","content":"In a distracting world, Joe's got the music to keep you focused.\n\n\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2019-01-26T13:48:17+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"pteXQCJTuGA","position":41,"timestamp":"01:45:01","rawTrack":"Sean Dream - Je Ne Sais Quoi","track":{"id":"kpYh0PxV94s","path":"/artists/sean-dream/tracks/je-ne-sais-quoi/","slug":"je-ne-sais-quoi","title":"Je Ne Sais Quoi